{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":9608,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1406674168,"Content":"<p>Hi Tammy,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I received a couple of complaints earlier today from a couple of girls that received the message below. They both already have photographers booked and don't know why they were pegged to receive this, but weren't overly thrilled about being pm'd for it. It doesn't appear that there are any posts that I can find but these ladies were messaged directly. Just wanted to pass it along.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks.<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\tChelseamasonphotography\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi there, sorry to bother you! But are you still looking for an affordable photographer that takes amazing photos?! Look no further! Take a look at our page run by Chelsea. She's the main photographer; I'm the second photographer. You can have BOTH our services for a full day including online gallery to all photos taken -special editing requests -fully enhanced images in high resolution on a DVD -full printing rights for an AMAZING price. Please contact Chelsea at chelseamasonphotography@<span><span>gmail.com<\/span><\/span> and let her know Shea sent you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.chelseamasonphotography.com\/Weddings.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.chelseama...m\/Weddings.html<\/a> Don't miss a moment of your beautiful day with Chelsea and Shea-Lyn! *WE DO DESTINATION WEDDINGS, just ask for pricing*<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"72307be2c0d8e63fd6b1e0bfd92c50b4","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":9611,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1406675096,"Content":"<p>that is spam. \u00a0I will delete their account.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"9dab90f942412b3a228fec032fa39e77","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":9612,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1406675762,"Content":"<p>Ok. Thanks. How are they able to do that on a site like this and get the user names of the ladies on the site so that it goes right to their private mailboxes? I've had only one, several months ago but both ladies today said they've had a few, which is why they decided to complain this time. I've explained about using the report click for this kind of thing, or at least to pass it on to me and I can report it for them. Is there something else I should be passing on to them?<\/p>\n","PostKey":"163ad99a049fd22aa7b584cf9fef9822","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":9613,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1406676064,"Content":"<p>they registered this morning and just started spamming people. \u00a0I have now limited newbies to only a few messages a day.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"da350a7050588ae191b772d4f576d07f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":9614,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1406677129,"Content":"<p>Ok. Thanks for the update. It's sad that there are always people that think they can get around rules. The good thing is these two ladies raised it rather than just deleting.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"156f3e5bfc72fe7bc3e76ee6d06a4f08","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":9616,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1406679897,"Content":"<p>I know. \u00a0It is really disappointing when people do that.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"17b70485e3ae241afa63f281f44ea87c","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
