{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":16268,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425563071,"Content":"<p>Hi Kim,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wondered if you've heard anything from Kim at all? She hasn't been around in quite some time so I just wondered if she's ok. I know people come and go from this site but she's a moderator so it implies different things. if you haven't heard anything I might check with Tammy and see if she has any news.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you're enjoying married life!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks.<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"036af95399a05aa12c0c674c443fe228","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16283,"Author":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425586092,"Content":"I haven't Ann sorry!!! I emailed her back last time we talked and haven't heard back!!<br><br>\nHopefully Tammy has!!!","PostKey":"4741bfb43a2db3c35d42774915bdf3b3","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16286,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425587774,"Content":"<p>Ok. Thanks. I'm going to shoot Tammy a note.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"90a1e3da2d87751fe78373d348c23f2f","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16287,"Author":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425590257,"Content":"<p>It's a tough one... I can see why she would stay away, but on the other side she has so much support here.<\/p>\n<p>Hopefully she will surface once she has time to heal.<\/p>\n<p>They may have A LOT to deal with too - ie, if they have to sell a mutual home, etc. So tough on everyone.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"67cbaaa03345d019cb7bbc8b44a3f670","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16288,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425591506,"Content":"<p>No she said the house is hers that he moved in with her. But you're right about the healing. It has to be tough. Just from the little she said though I think she had been wrestling with it for quite a while. Things were affecting her kids too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"2c921628c3a137d7720e6aca9b43cc76","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16289,"Author":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425591716,"Content":"<p>Oh good, hopefully he isn't trying to pull a fast one. I think after you become common law he can fight for half. only a douche would do it, but I've been it happen <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0 Poor girl and her kids, but I give her props for standing up for herself. I had to leave my kid's dad and it was tough, but she is a strong girl I can tell. \u00a0Hope she is oK!<\/p>\n","PostKey":"7ff6ab0ab6ffce736034f1fc96e98f64","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16292,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425592090,"Content":"<p>You're right about her being tough! She said some things about this guy that sort of made me wonder but I just hope he didn't lose it when she asked him to leave. That's why I just want to know she's ok. I guess her kids picked up on vibes, which I think was the straw that broke the camel's back.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"1112a9661aaf956bc251f0770ed598ef","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
