{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.207.201.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c013691a11ac2273cc49c4defea4d532","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so delayed in getting caught up on these threads! Thanks @[member=\"snswedding2016\"] for the heads up about this thread, so glad I caught it in time. I am free August 14th and always down for a good drink (or 5) especially on a Friday night ;). So is O&amp;amp;B our spot for that date? I work in Liberty Village and I&#039;m very new to commuting, but I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll figure it out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So O&amp;amp;B at 7pm on August 14th?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So excited to meet you ladies :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901900,"PostDate":1438772326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so delayed in getting caught up on these threads! Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> for the heads up about this thread, so glad I caught it in time. I am free August 14th and always down for a good drink (or 5) especially on a Friday night <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. So is O&B our spot for that date? I work in Liberty Village and I'm very new to commuting, but I'm sure I'll figure it out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So O&B at 7pm on August 14th?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So excited to meet you ladies :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurena1229@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.68.117.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430933265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laurena1229","Id":283004,"Name":"Laurena1229","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"020fd0f809675d934fc99c49d1e537c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my goodness - is that a date? With all the brides to be\/new brides here that would be mission accomplished if we have an agreement!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How about a last roll call?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901913,"PostDate":1438777976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh my goodness - is that a date? With all the brides to be\/new brides here that would be mission accomplished if we have an agreement!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How about a last roll call?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"06fd584bf6be2581f97e1eb99cb143ab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"medeash\" post=\"1901668\" timestamp=\"1438439467\"]\nI would love to join ladies! Does anyone have any dates in mind? September?\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk\nSorry totally missed the rest if the convo. I have a wedding on the 14th but if anything changes I&#039;ll be there!\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nI would 100% be open to a date in September if another get-together is planned :)  Still so sad I can&#039;t join this one :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1901923,"PostDate":1438781149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\