timestamp=\"1425575251\"]\nAnyone looking at or have just purchased a Maggie Sottero dress?\n\nI&#039;ve been looking at the Patience dress but can&#039;t find a lot of \"real pictures\" online.  Wondering if any DW brides have worn or plan to wear a Maggie and if they will be light and airy like they feel \/ look.[\/quote]@[member=\"ebecks\"] I tried on the Patience dress. This post is kind of old so I&#039;m sure you probably aren&#039;t still looking but just in case someone else wanted \"real\" pictures! I don&#039;t always look this pissed off, my mom was just randomly taking pictures. :D","Attachments":[{"Id":32327,"Name":"IMG_1110.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282903-0-04853500-1432091009.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282903-0-04853500-1432091009_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":32328,"Name":"IMG_1109.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282903-0-43588000-1432091053.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-282903-0-43588000-1432091053_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200}],"Id":1896630,"PostDate":1432076690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ebecks, on 05 March 2015 - 01:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Anyone looking at or have just purchased a Maggie Sottero dress?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been looking at the Patience dress but can't find a lot of \"real pictures\" online. \u00a0Wondering if any DW brides have worn or plan to wear a Maggie and if they will be light and airy like they feel \/ look.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281864\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281864-ebecks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ebecks<\/span><\/a> I tried on the Patience dress. This post is kind of old so I'm sure you probably aren't still looking but just in case someone else wanted \"real\" pictures! I don't always look this pissed off, my mom was just randomly taking pictures. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyg280@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.22.51.186","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430256601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282903.jpg?_r=1436298269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Ashleyg280","Id":282903,"Name":"Ashleyg280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.26.184.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c716179e98f0647aca4b891f1d629e81","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Ashleyg280\" post=\"1896630\" timestamp=\"1432091090\"]\n@[member=\"ebecks\"] I tried on the Patience dress. This post is kind of old so I&#039;m sure you probably aren&#039;t still looking but just in case someone else wanted \"real\" pictures! I don&#039;t always look this pissed off, my mom was just randomly taking pictures. :D[\/quote]Thanks so much for these pictures!!   I actually purchased this dress and am so anxious for it to come in.   The pictures helped remind me how much I love it.\n\nDid you buy this dress?  Or find another one?","Attachments":[],"Id":1896642,"PostDate":1432111393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Ashleyg280, on 19 May 2015 - 11:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281864\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281864-ebecks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ebecks<\/span><\/a> I tried on the Patience dress. This post is kind of old so I'm sure you probably aren't still looking but just in case someone else wanted \"real\" pictures! I don't always look this pissed off, my mom was just randomly taking pictures. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks so much for these pictures!! \u00a0 I actually purchased this dress and am so anxious for it to come in. \u00a0 The pictures helped remind me how much I love it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you buy this dress? \u00a0Or find another one?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erinlbecker@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.70.39.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422187291,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"ebecks","Id":281864,"Name":"ebecks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.145.113","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a82cc86d3e13cacf0d5b3df36afe1a33","RawContent":"@[member=\"ebecks\"] I actually haven&#039;t picked a dress yet! I&#039;m horrible and waiting until the last minute. This weekend I&#039;m going to one last shop and hopefully there will be one that I love, if not I have a couple others that I really liked to pick from. I liked the Patience dress a lot, but have decided I wanted a more fitted dress on the bottom. The only problem I&#039;ve ran into is when I find one I like the train is longer than what I&#039;m looking for.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896652,"PostDate":1432117566,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281864\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281864-ebecks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ebecks<\/span><\/a> I actually haven't picked a dress yet! I'm horrible and waiting until the last minute. This weekend I'm going to one last shop and hopefully there will be one that I love, if not I have a couple others that I really liked to pick from. I liked the Patience dress a lot, but have decided I wanted a more fitted dress on the bottom. The only problem I've ran into is when I find one I like the train is longer than what I'm looking for. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyg280@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.22.51.186","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430256601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282903.jpg?_r=1436298269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Ashleyg280","Id":282903,"Name":"Ashleyg280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca252b6e036c72cbc79756b62d5ea29b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Ashleyg280\" post=\"1896652\" timestamp=\"1432131966\"]\n@[member=\"ebecks\"] I actually haven&#039;t picked a dress yet! I&#039;m horrible and waiting until the last minute. This weekend I&#039;m going to one last shop and hopefully there will be one that I love, if not I have a couple others that I really liked to pick from. I liked the Patience dress a lot, but have decided I wanted a more fitted dress on the bottom. The only problem I&#039;ve ran into is when I find one I like the train is longer than what I&#039;m looking for.[\/quote]Have you considered having the train shortened on the dresses you really love but are too long? A good seamstress could def do that :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1896708,"PostDate":1432160810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Ashleyg280, on 20 May 2015 - 10:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281864\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281864-ebecks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ebecks<\/span><\/a> I actually haven't picked a dress yet! I'm horrible and waiting until the last minute. This weekend I'm going to one last shop and hopefully there will be one that I love, if not I have a couple others that I really liked to pick from. I liked the Patience dress a lot, but have decided I wanted a more fitted dress on the bottom. The only problem I've ran into is when I find one I like the train is longer than what I'm looking for.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHave you considered having the train shortened on the dresses you really love but are too long? A good seamstress could def do that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.67.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a29908509b41fc9687244136e287d2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies, Maggie Sottero is definitely one of the most popular designers for our brides at their destination weddings. The gowns seem to be made for beach and tropical weddings! Every bride we meet is unique and has their own personal taste, here are some of the lovely ladies in &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/maggie-sottero\/&#039;&gt;Maggie Sottero gowns&lt;\/a&gt; from our recent weddings.&amp;nbsp;\n\n&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Now-Jade-Wedding_JG_0010.jpg\" alt=\"Now-Jade-Wedding_JG_0010.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade_CJ_0092.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade_CJ_0092.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Beach-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_NC_0027.jpg\" alt=\"Beach-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_NC_0027.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/01\/Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun_BT_0125.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade-Riviera-Can\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Destination-Wedding-The-Reef-Playacar_LH_0145.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-The-Reef-Playacar_LH\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding-Riu-Palace-Mexico_IS_0005.jpg\" alt=\"Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding-Riu-Palace-Mexi\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_VL_0220.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_VL_\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/Destination-Wedding-Dreams-Tulum_JP_0074.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Dreams-Tulum_JP_0074\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/01\/Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Paraiso-Maya_EK_0136.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Paraiso-Ma\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Beach-Trash-Dress_KJ_0069.jpg\" alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Beach-Trash-Dress_KJ\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/11\/Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Trash-Dress_EB_0020.jpg\" alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Trash-Dress_EB_0020.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Show us your dress, what is your style? :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897424,"PostDate":1432814973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies, Maggie Sottero is definitely one of the most popular designers for our brides at their destination weddings. The gowns seem to be made for beach and tropical weddings! Every bride we meet is unique and has their own personal taste, here are some of the lovely ladies in <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/maggie-sottero\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Maggie Sottero gowns<\/a> from our recent weddings.\u00a0<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Now-Jade-Wedding_JG_0010.jpg\" alt=\"Now-Jade-Wedding_JG_0010.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade_CJ_0092.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade_CJ_0092.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Beach-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_NC_0027.jpg\" alt=\"Beach-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_NC_0027.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/01\/Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun_BT_0125.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Now-Jade-Riviera-Can\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Destination-Wedding-The-Reef-Playacar_LH_0145.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-The-Reef-Playacar_LH\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding-Riu-Palace-Mexico_IS_0005.jpg\" alt=\"Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding-Riu-Palace-Mexi\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/02\/Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_VL_0220.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Cancun_VL_\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/Destination-Wedding-Dreams-Tulum_JP_0074.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Dreams-Tulum_JP_0074\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/01\/Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Paraiso-Maya_EK_0136.jpg\" alt=\"Destination-Wedding-Iberostar-Paraiso-Ma\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Beach-Trash-Dress_KJ_0069.jpg\" alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Beach-Trash-Dress_KJ\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/11\/Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Trash-Dress_EB_0020.jpg\" alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Cenote-Trash-Dress_EB_0020.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Show us your dress, what is your style? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.64.174.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"135318863eb5159bd88bfeba6148222b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I bought a Maggie dress called \"Annette\" I looove it! cant wait til it comes in&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897427,"PostDate":1432818316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I bought a Maggie dress called \"Annette\" I looove it! cant wait til it comes in<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kandkjanzen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.108.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406125365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smellsey","Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78879","Title":"Maggie Sottero","LastPostDate":1432818316},"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
