y planning (I will be adding my engagement story soon!!) My first task is my wedding hashtag.&amp;nbsp; Only because I want to use it throughout the whole process (my wedding email ect..)&amp;nbsp; I was looking for something creative and maybe a play on words but something that won&#039;t be hard to remember for guests and easy to spell!&amp;nbsp; Our names are Nicole and Dan.&amp;nbsp; His last name that I will be taking is Cope.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far I&#039;ve thought of:&amp;nbsp; #StokedtobeaCope but we are getting married on the beach in Flordia, so I was tryng to put a beach flair to it.&amp;nbsp; Any ideas?? :huh:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900786,"PostDate":1437404690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!\u00a0 I am just starting all of my planning (I will be adding my engagement story soon!!) My first task is my wedding hashtag.\u00a0 Only because I want to use it throughout the whole process (my wedding email ect..)\u00a0 I was looking for something creative and maybe a play on words but something that won't be hard to remember for guests and easy to spell!\u00a0 Our names are Nicole and Dan.\u00a0 His last name that I will be taking is Cope.<\/p>\n<p>So far I've thought of:\u00a0 #StokedtobeaCope but we are getting married on the beach in Flordia, so I was tryng to put a beach flair to it.\u00a0 Any ideas?? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/huh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':huh:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email"